WEBVTT

00:00:07.643 --> 00:00:08.644
[GASPS]

00:00:11.864 --> 00:00:12.996
Run!

00:00:13.039 --> 00:00:14.127
[ALL PANTING]

00:00:21.874 --> 00:00:22.875
[GASPS]

00:00:23.702 --> 00:00:24.790
[ALL SCREAM]

00:00:41.111 --> 00:00:43.461
I don't understand.

00:00:43.505 --> 00:00:46.595
The sun was right here.
It was right here.

00:00:48.814 --> 00:00:50.163
[RUMBLING]

00:00:51.208 --> 00:00:52.949
We have to go
back to the cave.

00:00:52.992 --> 00:00:54.516
Hurry, hurry, hurry.

00:00:54.559 --> 00:00:57.823
Stay together.
Let's keep moving.
Move, move, move.

00:00:57.867 --> 00:00:59.477
Everybody,
hold my hand.

00:00:59.521 --> 00:01:02.132
Thunk, let's go.
Go, go, go.
Let's stay together.

00:01:03.307 --> 00:01:05.483
Grug.
What's wrong with you?

00:01:05.527 --> 00:01:08.617
Grug, we'll die
if we stay here!

00:01:21.020 --> 00:01:22.021
[GASPS]

00:01:32.249 --> 00:01:34.512
UGGA: Grug,
listen to me.

00:01:34.556 --> 00:01:37.210
We've got to get
back to that cave.

00:01:40.562 --> 00:01:42.520
No more dark.

00:01:43.260 --> 00:01:45.480
No more hiding.

00:01:46.002 --> 00:01:47.917
No more caves.

00:01:49.614 --> 00:01:51.616
What's the point
of all this?

00:01:55.707 --> 00:01:58.101
To follow the light.

00:02:01.800 --> 00:02:03.585
I can't change.

00:02:03.628 --> 00:02:05.804
I don't have ideas.

00:02:06.588 --> 00:02:09.025
But I have my strength.

00:02:09.068 --> 00:02:10.548
And right now...

00:02:10.592 --> 00:02:12.898
that's all you need.

00:02:14.596 --> 00:02:17.337
No, we don't know
what's over there.
Maybe nothing!

00:02:17.381 --> 00:02:19.296
It's too risky!

00:02:21.559 --> 00:02:22.821
It's a chance.

00:02:24.649 --> 00:02:26.216
Mmm.

00:02:26.259 --> 00:02:27.609
[SNIFFLES]
Oh...

00:02:32.527 --> 00:02:34.572
I'll take that chance.

00:02:36.052 --> 00:02:40.056
I've wanted
to throw you away
ever since I met you.

00:02:40.099 --> 00:02:41.144
[CHUCKLES]

00:02:41.187 --> 00:02:43.102
That's a joke, right?

00:02:43.146 --> 00:02:45.061
What's a "joke"?

00:02:55.941 --> 00:02:56.942
[GRUNTS]

00:03:08.432 --> 00:03:09.433
[GASPS]

00:03:15.439 --> 00:03:16.962
He made it!

00:03:18.660 --> 00:03:21.140
He made it.

00:03:24.100 --> 00:03:26.450
Okay, Thunk.
Your turn.

00:03:26.493 --> 00:03:28.452
You're not coming,
are you?

00:03:28.495 --> 00:03:30.976
When you make it,
so will I.

00:03:34.371 --> 00:03:35.633
[WHIMPERS]
[GRUNTS]

00:03:35.677 --> 00:03:36.808
[SCREAMING]

00:03:39.332 --> 00:03:40.333
No!

00:03:41.247 --> 00:03:42.379
Whee!

00:03:48.864 --> 00:03:50.561
You did good.

00:03:52.998 --> 00:03:54.391
Dadda!

00:03:55.392 --> 00:03:56.611
[CHUCKLES]

00:04:01.180 --> 00:04:02.399
SANDY: Whee!

00:04:06.533 --> 00:04:07.665
Gran--

00:04:07.709 --> 00:04:09.841
No mush.
Just throw me.

00:04:10.668 --> 00:04:11.930
Wait.

00:04:11.974 --> 00:04:14.672
You surprised me today...

00:04:14.716 --> 00:04:16.152
lunkhead.

00:04:18.197 --> 00:04:19.459
[GRUNTS]

00:04:21.853 --> 00:04:24.160
GRAN:
Still alive!

00:04:25.117 --> 00:04:26.510
Time to go.

00:04:26.553 --> 00:04:27.772
No.

00:04:27.816 --> 00:04:29.992
I have too much
to say to you.

00:04:30.035 --> 00:04:32.647
I need to fix everything,
and I don't have time.

00:04:32.690 --> 00:04:34.344
I can fix it.
[SOBS]

00:04:38.043 --> 00:04:39.566
This works good.

00:04:41.046 --> 00:04:43.353
What do you call it?

00:04:43.396 --> 00:04:47.836
I was thinking
of calling it a "hug."

00:04:47.879 --> 00:04:49.794
[CLEARS THROAT]
Because it rhymes
with "Grug."

00:04:51.883 --> 00:04:54.059
But you can
change it if you want.

00:04:55.060 --> 00:04:58.020
No. I like "hug."

00:05:03.895 --> 00:05:05.244
I love you.

00:05:08.726 --> 00:05:09.727
I-- [GASPS]

00:05:09.771 --> 00:05:10.902
[RUMBLING]

00:05:15.602 --> 00:05:16.995
Dad...

00:05:17.779 --> 00:05:19.650
I'm scared.

00:05:19.694 --> 00:05:22.087
Never be afraid.

00:05:26.309 --> 00:05:27.614
[GRUNTS]

00:05:32.794 --> 00:05:33.969
[RUMBLING]
[GASPS]

00:05:37.494 --> 00:05:38.713
[GRUG YELLING]

00:05:49.288 --> 00:05:50.376
[GRUNTS]

00:05:53.162 --> 00:05:54.467
[PANTING]

00:05:59.777 --> 00:06:00.996
There!

00:06:01.039 --> 00:06:02.301
I see him!

00:06:09.831 --> 00:06:10.832
[SIGHS]

00:06:11.789 --> 00:06:13.399
[RUMBLING]
Ah!

00:06:13.443 --> 00:06:14.661
[GRUNTING]

00:06:19.841 --> 00:06:20.929
Ah!

00:06:30.808 --> 00:06:32.070
[PANTING]

